---

<div class="icon-btn-bad-demo">
  <div class="icon-btn-bad-demo__group">
    <button class="icon-btn-bad"
      >次へ進む <svg
        class="icon-btn-good__icon"
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#111"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
        focusable="false"
      >
        <path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5"></path>
      </svg></button
    >
  </div>
  <p class="icon-btn-bad-demo__note">
    強制カラーモードでは背景画像として埋め込んだ矢印アイコンが消えます。
  </p>
</div>

<style lang="scss">
  .icon-btn-bad-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: $space-md;
  }

  .icon-btn-bad-demo__label {
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
    color: $color-text-muted;
  }

  .icon-btn-bad-demo__group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: $space-sm;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .icon-btn-bad-demo__note {
    font-size: $font-size-xs;
    color: $color-text-muted;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .icon-btn-bad {
    @include button-reset;
    position: relative;
    // 右側にアイコン分の余白: 12px(右端) + 16px(icon) + 8px(gap) = 36px
    padding: $space-sm 36px $space-sm $space-md;
    border-radius: $border-radius-md;
    font-size: $font-size-sm;
    font-weight: $font-weight-semibold;
    background-color: $color-bg;
    color: $color-text;
    border: 1px solid $color-border;

    // Bad: background-image で矢印を描画 → forced-colors で完全に消える
    svg {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      right: 12px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
    }

    &:hover {
      background-color: $color-surface;
    }
  }
</style>
